@startuml
left to right direction

actor "Student / Researcher" as User

rectangle "IR Indexing Engine" {
  rectangle "CLI Orchestrator\n(main.py)" as Main
  rectangle "Indexing Container\n(indexer.py + multiprocessing workers)" as Indexing
  rectangle "Query Container\n(query.py)" as Query
  rectangle "Evaluation Container\n(evaluate.py)" as Eval
  rectangle "Visualization Container\n(visualize_results.py)" as Viz
  rectangle "Text Processing Container\n(core.py)" as Text
  rectangle "Datastore Adapter\n(datastore.py)" as DS
}

cloud "Wikipedia Dataset\n(local disk)" as Dataset
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
folder "Pickle Index Files\n(partial + final)" as Pickle
folder "CSV/PNG Outputs" as Outputs
cloud "NLTK Data" as NLTK

User --> Main : runs pipeline
Main --> Indexing : dispatch build configs/chunks
Main --> Query : constructs evaluator
Main --> Eval : runs benchmarks
Main --> Viz : optional result plotting

Indexing --> Text : normalize tokens
Query --> Text : normalize query terms
Text --> NLTK : load stopwords/tokenizer

Indexing --> Pickle : save/load index blocks
Indexing --> DS : merge to DB
Query --> DS : fetch postings/doc freq
DS --> PG : SQL operations

Eval --> Query : execute TAAT/DAAT queries
Eval --> Outputs : write evaluation CSV
Viz --> Outputs : read CSV / write plots

Indexing --> Dataset : read source documents

@enduml
